EMENO has been operating for over 19 years as a specialized project company offering solutions in the field of electrical power supply.
Our products arise in due consideration of particular requirements of our customers as well as technical specifications of the devices.

If you decide on cooperation with EMENO, you will obtain:
-	the latest solutions and technologies ensuring best stability and security of the single elements;
-	full functionality of power supply systems, even under extreme operating conditions;
-	the possibility of conducting tests and providing the end-product with needed certificates
-	transparent prices and projects;
-	small and large production series;
-	continuous contact to our project manager and real influence on the end effect;
-	Understanding of needs and requirements of your industry.

EMENO specializes in production of energy supply kits, that base on Li-ion-technology as well as original battery management systems (BMS). We also work with Lithium, Nickel-metal-hydride and Nickel-cadmium technologies.

Our experience and the variety of executed projects allow us to assume the position of a specialist in designing solutions for a wide range of industries, among others for electric mobility, power tools, industrial robots, home and garden robots, medical devices, fiscal cash registers, security, communication and green energy.

You are in need of an energy supplying source? 
Do not hesitate to contact us!

ZÖLLNER – We design your safety solutions.

Wir bei ZÖLLNER haben die Vision, mit unseren Leistungen weltweit zur Sicherheit im Schiffs- und Bahnverkehr beizutragen. Wir sind stolz, der international führende Anbieter und Partner für Lösungen zu sein, die die Sicherheit für Menschen in einer komplexen, digitalisierten und globalisierten Welt verbessern.

// At ZÖLLNER, our vision is to contribute to safety in shipping and rail transport worldwide with our services. We are proud to be the leading international provider and partner for solutions that improve safety for people in a complex, digitalised and globalised world.

Prana is a manufacturer of mechanical ventilation systems with recuperation. Our systems work on the base of a patented copper heat exchanger which provides recuperation efficiency up to 98%.

We manufacturе decentralized and centralized systems which are suitable for:
•	offices;
•	malls;
•	beauty salons;
•	restaurants;
•	premises;
•	industrial objects.

Decentralized systems can be mounted in less than 2 hours and are controlled with remote control or mobile application. Recuperators are provided with AUTO mode as well, with the help of which the system independently reacts on the air quality, quantity of people in the room and regulates the air exchange speed.

With PRANA you will always receive quality air for the well-being of your employees or guests.

Text us to get the price list of our ventilation systems or to discuss the partnership always.

